{"server":"tw","storyId":"act26side_level_act26side_06_end","groupId":"act26side","stageId":"act26side_06","title":"夜半歌聲","storyCode":"HE-6","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_06_end.txt","sourceHash":"62a8a958041e07d32e8610972260d1e93c10efd1a239cedb66528ff6bef721b5","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"奧倫的計劃遭到眾人反對，爭執之中，一道人影帶著某樣“物品”，出現在眾人眼前。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g11_monasterycorridor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊蒙德，等一下......萊蒙德！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要幹什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帶你離開這。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事情我都聽說了，那些人別想就這麼抓到你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你別害怕，跟我走就好，我們都會幫你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？不......我沒有害怕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊蒙德，你先鬆手......你誤會了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉！是我太著急了......很疼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你聽我說，萊蒙德！我是、我是自願跟他們去拉特蘭的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別說胡話了！他們拿什麼威脅你了？你去那裡會死的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也是我罪有應得！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別管我了，萊蒙德，沒有人強迫我也沒有人威脅我，是我害了菲娜，我不能就這麼逃走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德爾菲娜......那是個意外......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不！我不想連你也說什麼“那是個意外”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"意外......意外！是啊，我怎麼可能會故意拿銃對著菲娜，那只是個可悲的意外......但是菲娜真的死了！死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊蒙德，菲娜不會再睜開眼睛，不會再和我們說話了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"福爾圖娜，冷靜......別這樣抓，別傷到你自己！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想冷靜下來的......我也不想這樣又哭又叫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是為什麼沒有人因此責備我？！為什麼所有人都說只是個意外，好像菲娜她的死用一個輕飄飄的“意外”就可以一筆帶過一樣？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲娜她、她被我殺死了！是不是意外有區別嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......喘氣，別憋著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好點了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，我不該這樣......但是萊蒙德，我不知道該怎麼辦才好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道......我不能走，不能逃，不能當作什麼都沒有發生，不能真的認可那是個意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是我的罪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你別擔心我，萊蒙德，或許也沒有那麼糟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯普莉雅，就是今天來的那位拉特蘭的使者小姐，她對我很好，我沒有吃什麼苦頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許回到拉特蘭後他們會把我關起來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我長出了角......我也不知道現在我還算不算是薩科塔，不過，就算不是也沒什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，我沒事的，萊蒙德，你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然還是不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"福爾圖娜，我不能就這麼放著你不管——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊蒙德？你怎麼了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（先別說話！屏住呼吸......！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（......？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（......有人過來了！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g11_monasterycorridor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他掛了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼不知道，你居然已經把里凱萊策反了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"策反談不上，他就是那種人，只做對自己有利的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在自保這方面，他比我還有本事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總覺得好像有人在盯著我看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，奧倫你是終於多疑到出現幻覺了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起幻覺，我更願意相信是真的有什麼人躲在角落裡偷聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，別那樣看我，開個玩笑而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你看著的那個墮天使小姑娘呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她啊，應該已經乖乖睡著了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別扯了，說回正題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛剛說計劃提前？可以是可以，不過這可和說好的不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼突然修改計劃？給我一個理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對你來說沒什麼區別不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是沒什麼區別，所以我也可以選擇不合作囉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果我沒記錯，這次的調動權在我，斯普莉雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以回去寫檢討。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好像有點急躁，奧倫。到底怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次本來就不是擺在台面上的行動，如果不是教宗閣下忽然被什麼聖徒的事情吸引了注意，要調動部隊可沒有那麼容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是這樣，教宗閣下似乎還是察覺到了什麼，還特地派了費德里科......嘖，想要瞞住費德里科那傢伙有多難你不會不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真覺得自己瞞住了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大機率沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我也算是摸清楚他的性子了，只要他不深究，就問題不大。反正我們的目的只是攔截所有想離開的人不是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反而是你，奧倫，一旦你下令讓部隊動手，這事可就真的瞞不住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科不是會在意手段的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可不好說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提前申明，他要是想對你動手，我沒這個本事攔住他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是可悲的同事情誼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰會在這時候聯絡我......呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你自己看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"立刻把奧倫帶到入口大廳來。\n——費德里科"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來是完全沒瞞住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說的那些我自會處理，斯普莉雅，現在按我說的去做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓能行動的部隊都過來，立刻由我們的人接管整座修道院。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真有這麼急？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個和修道院同生共死六十年的老人，為了那些薩卡茲一意孤行，甚至能做出扣押拉特蘭使者這種事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他被逼到絕路，卻忽然鬆口，還提出要做“最後的道別”如此有儀式感的事......你覺得會是因為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再加上一群有點來頭的薩卡茲，還有隱身在暗處的幾位“客人”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的動作要快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我總有種不好的預感......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接管......？什麼意思......為什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還不明白嗎？！那個薩科塔一直都在騙我們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得去告訴杰拉爾德老大！我就知道！那些拉特蘭人從一開始就沒安好心......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"福爾圖娜，現在和我一起反而會有危險，你找一個安全的地方等我，他們應該不會立刻對你動手——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，萊蒙德！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我改變主意了。我要和你一起去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g1_monasteryentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好巧啊，兩位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾繆安女士，太好了，你安然無恙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼收穫嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看起來有些憂慮，執行者里凱萊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在追查一件我有點在意的事，和那位主教閣下有關，但......嗯，總之還需要繼續調查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，費德里科，你在做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我當然知道你是在工作......你發現什麼了？是不是和薩卡茲有關？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說晚上的那場火災是薩卡茲那邊有人心生不滿，故意放火，這是真的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼新式的娛樂節目嗎？你們的即興相聲表演？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玩笑到此為止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玩笑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧倫和斯普莉雅很快會過來會合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，這個口氣......費德里科，你從一開始就知道奧倫是故意躲起來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顯而易見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他真不走運，前不久萬國峰會的時候才和你對上，這次偏偏又碰上你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，之前奧倫按照自己的判斷私自行動，我也是默許的。畢竟安布羅修修道院的情況這麼複雜，不留一點後手可不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，我總覺得他現在需要一點點提醒......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人聯繫我說要立刻趕到，還讓我捎上奧倫，到底出了什麼急事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？奧倫，你終於肯乖乖露面啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，好久不見啊，蕾繆安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這不是在合作完成任務嘛，別說得這麼生分......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正因為是合作夥伴，所以現在你還可以站在這裡說話哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管你有什麼樣的計劃......你那種強硬的做法不太適合現在的修道院，差不多該停手了，奧倫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你和費德里科就不能學學旁邊那位，假裝什麼都不知情嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能別拉我下水嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里凱萊的問題在回到公證所後自然會清算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我謝謝你，奧倫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於你，奧倫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你確實判斷有單獨行動的必要，可以嘗試說服我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這裡沒有其他人了，我就直說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯普莉雅，你難道真以為我沒發現你偷偷摸摸想放走那兩個年輕人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個墮天的薩科塔和一個薩卡茲，他們顯眼得讓我想假裝看不見都難啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這傢伙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坦白說，我早就有點不耐煩這種磨磨蹭蹭的感覺了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來你是在指責我的做法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不敢。不敢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，我也有我的做法。我們已經在這裡耗掉了不少時間，總該考慮考慮，怎麼才能儘快完成工作，還不出任何紕漏吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說的做法就是私自調動特勤部隊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別說得好像這很輕易一樣嘛。你知道的，“調動部隊”和“下令行動”是兩回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了能有一個合適的、妥當的、教宗閣下也無法反對的行動理由，我可是苦惱了好一陣子啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在正好，現成的藉口送上門來了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個薩卡茲小子，是叫萊蒙德吧？燒毀聖堂可是大罪，更遑論他還是個薩卡茲，我們接手後不論是扣押還是展開後續調查，都不過分吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"燒毀聖堂的犯人不是他，你所謂的理由並不成立。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我查清真相之前，不需要你的隊伍介入。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真相，哈，真相如何真的那麼重要嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我們的人接管這裡，把一切都安排妥帖，這難道不是最高效、最合理的做法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科，你難道沒有這麼考慮過？你真有這麼看重真相？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧倫，你這樣做，難道就不怕這裡的居民反抗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾繆安，我以為你不會說這樣的傻話。如果有薩卡茲要反抗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是更理想了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰在外面！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"叩門聲在陡然安靜下來的大廳中迴響。\n門扉發出令人牙酸的吱呀響聲，室外異常明亮的月光透過打開的門縫安靜地灑入。\n有人獨自站在一線月光中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科先生......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_i06"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"克萊芒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......終於找到你了，費德里科先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有人，托我把“這個”轉交給您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是誰委託你？這是——"},{"type":"narration","text":"未出口的話音在空氣中戛然而止。\n背著光的人影緩慢地走近，瘦高的男人始終低低地垂著頭。\n整間屋子的光此時好像都聚集於他一人，可過於刺眼的光亮，又反在人的身上抹出濃重駭人的陰影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"費德里科終於看清對方手上捧著的東西。\n那據說是旁人托克萊芒轉交給他的東西。\n一把匕首。\n陳舊但鋒利，曾被藏於某人的身後。\n而在匕首旁......\n那用布包裹著，下方被染成紅色，還有液體不斷溢出的東西。\n......那是什麼？\n那是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是......“罪人”霍斯特·蒂芬達爾自願獻上的頭顱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“罪人”已承認所有惡事都是其一人所為，所有罪名，都由其一人承擔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如今首惡伏誅，剩下的只是一群流民，不足掛齒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"希望......希望拉特蘭的各位使者，能夠就此手下留情，不再繼續追究。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g1_monasteryentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科先生，他、杰拉爾德他在臨走前要我對你說——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他請求你，求你帶走通緝犯霍斯特的頭顱和武器......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放過福爾圖娜和萊蒙德......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放過其他薩卡茲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
